      "text": "Retain derived, unobserved successful future A: trolley B4-B7 at 0-3, trolley B8-B11 at 3-6, hand B12 at 6-7. Completion-before-unloading lets whole loads fit without waiting. Continuous inspection finishes at 13. Dependencies: two trolley allowances and one hand trip; predicted occupation is seven transfer and thirteen inspection minutes."
